Eijen implementation material for the ICCS cryptographic hash submission format.

Directory layout:
- Reference_Implementation/Eijen-*: ISO C99 reference implementations using the required CryptHash API.
- Optimized_Implementation/Eijen-*: x86-64 optimized implementations using the same CryptHash API.
- Additional_Implementation/: no additional implementation is submitted in this package.

Run scripts/build_all.sh from the package root to build all instance packages.
